{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9d6af76576dc4c6e","name":"Lineage Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-9d6af76576dc4c6e","title":"Lineage Talent Tree","revision":26290,"timestamp":"2025-03-12T01:30:54Z","sha256":"82b8d5b2d64b3ce1515b5957857e8c03287c6bdfeba8c84d3c2874f0986629de","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26290","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Lineage%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9d6af76576dc4c6e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You lead a privileged life and reap the benefit of an upbringing beyond most citizens of the galaxy.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Connections"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You are able to obtain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Licensed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Licensed"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"}," equipment without having to pay a licensing fee or endure a background check, provided the total cost of the desired ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," is equal to or less than your Character Level x 1,000 credits. In addition, when obtaining ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Services"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Services"}," through the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Market"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Market"},", you reduce the black market cost multiplier by 1.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Educated"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Thanks to your well-rounded education, you may make any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"}," check ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Spontaneous Skill"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Educated"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Sometimes you surprise others with your skill. Once per day, you may make an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"}," skill check as though you were ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"},". Exception: you cannot use this Talent to make an Untrained ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check as though you were ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the skill, unless you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Sensitivity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Sensitivity","referenceId":"reference:5202cab02f367bcf"}," feat.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can select this Talent multiple times; each time you do, you can use it one additional time per day.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Wealth"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Each time you gain a level (including the level at which you select this Talent), you receive an amount of credits equal to 5,000 x your Class Level. You can spend these credits as you see fit. The credits appear in a civilized, accessible location of your choice or in your private bank account.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Engineer Lineage"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Engineer in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Engineer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Engineer","referenceId":"reference:d93352a70395db3d"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Educated"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Technology)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Technology)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," skill. Additionally, when installing new systems into a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", the efficiency of your designs reduces the time it takes to install the system by 25%.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Influential Friends"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Connections"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Influential Contacts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influential_Contacts","referenceId":"reference:9ee96c5e020facb9"}," within a certain organization, planet, or region who can provide concrete information to you on certain subjects. Once per day, you can have one of these contacts make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," on your behalf. The contact always ",{"tag":"a","children":["Takes 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Takes_20"}," on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," (even if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," would normally not allow ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taking 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taking_20"},") and has a Skill modifier equal to 5 + one-half your Heroic Level. Contacting your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Influential Contacts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influential_Contacts","referenceId":"reference:9ee96c5e020facb9"}," and receiving the benefit of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," takes a number of minutes equal to 10 x the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," result.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Powerful Friends"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Influential Friends"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have a powerful contact who has an extended sphere of influence. The contact could be an Imperial Senator, a high-level military officer, a regional governor, an infamous crime lord, or another person of similar significance. Once per encounter, you can invoke the name or office of your powerful contact and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Take 20"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Take_20"}," on one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check, with no increase in the time needed to make the check. \n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
